Description: Provides arbitrary-precision decimal vectors backed by the
    vendored 'mpdecimal' C library. Values are exact and serializable,
    arithmetic is controlled by an explicit decimal context, and vectors are
    integrated with 'vctrs' so they behave naturally in data frames, tibbles,
    summaries, and common numeric workflows. Version 0.1.0 is a correctness-
    first release focused on exact construction, context-aware arithmetic,
    comparison, summaries, and special-value handling.
